units real
atom_style full

dimension 3
boundary p p p

bond_style hybrid harmonic
angle_style hybrid harmonic
dihedral_style hybrid charmm
special_bonds lj 0.0 0.0 0.5 coul 0.0 0.0 0.5

read_data dihedral1_vacuum_converted.lmp

pair_style lj/cut/coul/cut 20.0 20.0
kspace_style none

pair_coeff 1 1   0.0660000   3.5000000
pair_coeff 2 2   0.0300000   2.5000000
pair_coeff 3 3   0.1700000   3.1200000
pair_coeff 4 4   0.0000000   0.0000000

pair_modify mix geometric

thermo_style custom ebond eangle edihed eimp epair evdwl ecoul elong etail pe

run 0
